OL,3,GNEWSARail firm donates lost property to
OL,4,Awomen's refuges
OL,5,
OL,6,FBelongings which go unclaimed after
OL,7,Fbeing left behind at railway stations
OL,8,Fand on trains will be donated to
OL,9,Fwomen's refuges.
OL,11,FGreater Anglia is taking part in a
OL,12,Ftrial to make use of the hundreds of
OL,13,Fitems left languishing in lost property
OL,14,Foffices across its network.
OL,16,FIt said refuges in Cambridgeshire,
OL,17,FEssex, Suffolk and Greater London could
OL,18,Frequest things they needed, with a
OL,19,Ffirst donation recently made of
OL,20,Ftoiletries and other personal items.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,375,370,200,160,0,100
